{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23953","headline":"桥亭卯饮 · 白居易","name":"桥亭卯饮","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"卯时偶饮斋时卧，林下高桥桥上亭。\n松影过窗眠始觉，竹风吹面醉初醒。\n就荷叶上包鱼鮓，当石渠中浸酒缾。\n生计悠悠身兀兀，甘从妻唤作刘伶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23953.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23953","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}